and it involves effort. Can you explain what you do maybe with a specific example? Yeah, well, and I'll start off by, you know, going back to Michelle Obama. Michelle Obama says that what she does is essentially, you know, she works hard. She works harder. So whenever I doubted myself, I just told myself, let me put my head down and do the work. And I would let my work speak for itself.

67
00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:39.000
